# Large data files. The raw phase-resolved field archives of the temporal campaign
# (results/09_d2_capture/capture_*.npz, 448 MB for the seven files, the N=512 ones
# above GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit) are excluded from the git tree and shipped as
# bundle/PoF_d2_captures_v1.tar; results/09_d2_capture/MANIFEST.md, which is
# committed, indexes them with their sizes and SHA-256 checksums. Everything the text
# needs as input or as provenance is committed.
*.npz
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.csv
!data/lid_series/*.npz
!data/lid_series/manifest.csv
!data/lid_series_n512/*.npz
!results/07_d2_smoke/smoke_d2.npz
!results/08_stokes_analytic/*.npz
!results/p1_gci_iso/*.csv
!results/01_ReE_star_map/branch_runs.csv
!results/02_lambda_var/*.csv
!supplementary/data_appendix/*.csv
!results/d2_derived/topology_numbers.txt
!results/09_d2_capture/capture_d2_*.log

